# _redirects — same format and location as _headers. First match wins.
#
# Path-only sources, on purpose. Workers static assets do not support
# domain-level sources ("https://host/* …" is listed as unsupported in the
# Cloudflare docs), so the old-hostname catch-all is NOT here: it is a
# Redirect Rule on the plan-t.org.il zone — see docs/cutover-runbook.md §2.
#
# Every target is absolute to the new host so a hit on either old hostname
# lands in ONE hop once that hostname reaches this Worker.
#
# Hebrew sources are listed twice, raw and percent-encoded, because both
# forms arrive in the wild.

